# Local scratch — working files kept out of the repository.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `src/` also matches
# `mtk-optimizer/app/src/`, which silently keeps the app's own new source files
# out of the repository.
/_*
/tmp/
/g*.json
/gh*.json
/hdrs/
/src/
/s_*.xml
